Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: @UPSTREAM_NAME@
Upstream-Contact: @SOURCE@
Source: @SOURCE@

Comment:
 This package redistributes, unmodified, the model archive published in the
 postvec model registry's public channel under the name
 @MODEL_NAME@.
 .
 The registry revision, the archive digest and a SHA-256 digest of every
 packaged file are recorded in SOURCE.json and model-files.sha256 beside this
 file, in @DOC_DIR@.
 .
 A verbatim copy of the licence travels with the weights themselves, under
 /opt/postvec/ninference/models/, which is what a redistribution licence
 requires and what a reader of the installed model directory will look for.

